        "reference": "tests/workflows/PROTOCOL.md",
        "changed_from_prior_canaries": [
          "sentinel-framed write content transport (<<<CONTENT / CONTENT>>>) after the action JSON: no JSON-string escaping, truncation keeps complete lines",
          "content_truncated recovery: partial sentinel content is written, with a resume anchor (line count + last written line) steering chunked append continuation",
          "backend-aware budgets: STEP_TOKENS=4096 and STEP_WRITE_TOKENS=8192 on OpenRouter; local 256/512 unchanged",
          "write-forcing executor policy on write-shaped tasks: after WRITE_PRESSURE_OBSERVATIONS=3 executed observation steps the next action must commit",
          "observation actions cannot consume the last OBSERVE_TAIL_RESERVE=3 steps of an attempt (observe_tail_reserved warning skip, then observe_tail_exhausted auto-fail)",
          "first-class no_write_executed flag in full and task-local replan state, scoped to the failed task's steps"
        ],
        "deterministic_acceptance_tests": "tests/test_agent_actions.py",
        "why_v5": "Protocol v4 was consumed by the 2026-08-01 canaries (one attempt per cell, both empty-patch unresolved); the action interface changed to revision 3 (issue #15, PR #16) after those results, so a new protocol version is required before the next outcome-bearing run."
